  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Masterclas &apos;Circular Economy for Food Systems Transformation&apos;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this masterclass on &#x201C;Capacity building for Circular Economy in Ethiopian Agribusiness&#x201D; is to provide high-impact skills to train two groups of stakeholders; owners and professionals from the private sector of agribusiness and; partners from the development sector responsible for designing and implementing the various portfolios and programs within the overarching Multi-Year Country Strategy (MACS) that outlines the priority areas of international cooperation between the Netherlands and Ethiopia from 2023 to 2026.</narrative>
  </description>
